sequenceDiagram
    participant model as Role model
    participant harness as Harness
    participant driver as Driver / observation
    participant collector as Collector
    participant android as Android
    harness->>driver: Capture current observation O1
    par Pixels
        driver->>android: Acquire pixels via scrcpy / ADB
        android-->>driver: Pixels, frame position and geometry
    and UI structure
        driver->>collector: Request tree and window state
        collector-->>driver: Tree, window generation and handles
    end
    driver-->>harness: Deliver checked observation O1
    harness->>model: Task, context and O1
    model-->>harness: Action and observation ID of O1
    harness->>driver: Validate O1 and target, then dispatch
    driver->>driver: Record frame position, no extra capture
    driver->>android: Execute action via the selected path
    android-->>driver: Dispatch result
    driver->>driver: Commit boundary on success, capture O2
    driver-->>harness: Receipt and accepted post-observation O2
    harness->>model: Persist and deliver O2 for next decision
